@startuml
title SVG CLI — planned module dependencies (stage 1)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "src/main.ts\nComposition root" as bootstrap
package "cli" as cli
package "application" as app
package "commands\nCommand interfaces + implementations" as commands
package "domain" as domain
package "ports" as ports
package "infrastructure" as infra
package "presentation" as presentation

bootstrap ..> cli
bootstrap ..> app
bootstrap ..> infra
cli ..> app
cli ..> commands
cli ..> presentation
cli ..> domain : create argument definitions
app ..> commands
app ..> domain
app ..> ports
commands ..> domain
commands ..> ports
presentation ..> domain
infra ..> ports
infra ..> domain
ports ..> domain
note bottom of domain
No CLI, filesystem or concrete infrastructure imports.
Stage 6: all editing commands and reversible tree operations implemented.
SVG IO and canvas command are still planned.
domain/internal is used only by Shape, Group and SvgDocument.
